mlx-ddcolor-swift
=================

This repository is a from-scratch MLX-Swift architecture port (no pre-existing MLX
implementation) of DDColor:

  DDColor — Copyright (c) DAMO Academy, Alibaba Group — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/piddnad/DDColor
  "DDColor: Towards Photo-Realistic Image Colorization via Dual Decoders" (ICCV 2023)

The ConvNeXt encoder block is adapted from:

  ConvNeXt — Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates — MIT License
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/ConvNeXt

The Swift/MLX port (`Sources/DDColor`, `Sources/MLXDDColor`) and the cv2-exact LAB
pipeline are original to this repository and licensed MIT (see LICENSE). The DDColor
architecture and the original PyTorch weights remain under Apache-2.0 (piddnad/DDColor).

Converted MLX weights (fp16) are published to Hugging Face mlx-community:
  - mlx-community/DDColor-paper-tiny-fp16   (ConvNeXt-T)
  - mlx-community/DDColor-modelscope-fp16   (ConvNeXt-L, recommended default)
  - mlx-community/DDColor-artistic-fp16     (ConvNeXt-L, stylized)
Collection: https://huggingface.co/collections/mlx-community/ddcolor-mlx

